{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56645","headline":"箜篌谣 · 无名氏","name":"箜篌谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结交在相得，骨肉何必亲。\n甘言无忠实，世薄多苏秦。\n从风暂靡草，富贵上昇人（一作「真」）。\n不见高颠树，摧杌下爲薪。\n岂甘（一作「目覩」）井中泥，时至出作尘。\n（见《文苑英华》卷二一○。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}